<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange ended mixed in active trading Wednesday.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average fell 45.32 to 6563.84.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite fell 2.02 to 400.29.</p>
<p>The average price per share was down $0.21.</p>
<p>Winners beat losers 1271 to 1209.</p>
<p>Volume was 451,492,500 compared with 448,855,680 on Tuesday.</p>
